# Browser
# Theorist's Sanctum in the browser. "As this land enters, you may behold a Jace" is an optional choice, not a cost: the page
# asks it in words that say so ("you may choose a Jace you control or reveal a Jace card from your hand to behold") and the
# confirm button says "Behold it" once Jace, the Mind Sculptor is picked in the hand. Empower Jace then makes the Jace
# planeswalker token, which the page draws as a Token Planeswalker - Jace with its two loyalty abilities.

[Bot1 Deck]
Theorist's Sanctum
Black Lotus
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Theorist's Sanctum: you may choose a Jace you control or reveal a Jace card from your hand to behold
Bot1.Choose(Jace, the Mind Sculptor)
? Client.Bot1.Confirm = Behold it
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum.Activate(Ability: Empower)
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.TypeLine = Token Planeswalker - Jace
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Rules = −1: Surveil 1. / −3: Draw a card.

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 2
Bot1.Revealed = Jace, the Mind Sculptor
